// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Anti-Matter 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 32 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Anti-Matter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2036207087" "Anti-Matter"
// ProfessionString :
"P2028199903" "Praetor Keyes"
// DescriptionString :
"P856364347" ""
// LocationString :
"P144179779" "Rift Enclosure"
// HelloString :
"P1520413120" "I don't have time to discuss anything other than the matter at hand.  Be quick about it."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3980047513" "Begone with your simpleton self, fool.  Can you not see that I am devoting every last synapse within my brain to alleviate the current situation?  Bother me again and I will be sorely tempted to annihilate you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2224012498" "Since I'm in direct contact with you, HeroName, you'll refer to me by my real name, Anti-Matter.  I don't have time for the Praetor formalities.  I've heard that you are the best amongst those loyal to Praetoria, which is why I have requisitioned your services.  The work I am doing here in the Fringe is of the upmost importance to Emperor Cole, therefore it is only logical that it is as important to you, too.  I have a vital task that I am about to entrust to you.  I am hoping for your sake that you understand the gravity of the situation."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3601061370" "I currently have the situation under control.  I am tasking you to root out all Resistance traitors and deal with them in an appropriately painful manner."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3845110362" "My requirements for use of your services involve you not having too many tasks.  Return to me when you are not so distracted."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2538482287" "The task I have for you is something that would require someone like me to take care of.  Unless you can find some way to augment your powers to an equivalent of Security Level {Level}, I can not use you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P636742338" "You have proven to be a worthy asset.  Once I have personally ensured Emperor Cole's entry into Primal Earth, I was review your record and suggest a commendation for your work.  During the interim, you will report directly to me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3459514890" "Your efforts in assisting me with slowing down this traitorous coup will earn you a rank in the upper echelons of Praetoria's government.  Depending on a full analysis of your record, it is entirely possible that when this coup d'etat has been quashed, you may even be granted Praetorship."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P1649414996" "I don't trust your motives, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1667030216" "I'm unsure what we have to discuss."
// IntroString :
"P612594318" "There's someone I want you to meet.  Here is their contact information.  I think you would be inclined to work with them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3751841202" "Meet New Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2022483603" "This contact I've introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you've chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2557049975" "I've got someone I think you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P799934329" "There's a couple of people you should talk to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


