// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Doctor_Steffard 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 33 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Doctor Steffard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3879875617" "Doctor Steffard"
// ProfessionString :
"P1899223520" "Assistant to Anti-Matter"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3768594290" "How could we have allowed Hamidon to gain so much power of us?  How much hubris are we capable of?  No.  I will do what must be done to stop him, even if I have to go against what I believe in."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4094080522" "I'm running calibrations on some sensitive equipment.  If you need to talk with someone, try speaking with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3418946735" "My name is Gustav Steffard, and I've been assisting Anti-Matter with calibrations to the dimensional portal.  However, I haven't been assisting him in the hopes the portal would open, but rather to sabotage it.  But now, seeing how Volkov has switched over to my way of thinking for all the wrong reasons, I am slowly realizing too late that our infighting has opened the door to everyone's damnation.  Now I find that I truly am on Anti-Matter's side, for no other reason than to try to save the world for all of humanity.  Perhaps it's not too late to stop Hamidon."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3041108138" "I'm not sure if what we did will save mankind, but I have to believe that it will.  It appears that all we have left at this point is hope.  Pray that it's enough."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P757560990" "Since you have too many tasks right now, I can't ask you to assist me, {HeroName}.  I just have to hope I'm strong enough to do this on my own."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3827776560" "I can't have another person's death on my conscience, {HeroName}.  You'll need to be Security Level {Level} in order for me to feel that you can handle my task."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2780850848" "I didn't think I could trust you in the beginning, {HeroName}, but you've shown me that my risk paid off.  I'm giving you my direct number so we can work together more effectively."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3355766888" "Your assistance may have helped prevent the destruction of mankind.  Thank you, {HeroName}."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


