// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Professor Volkov 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P973005384" "Professor Volkov"
// ProfessionString :
"P2281836282" "Dimensional Professor"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P432944602" "Our work is very important to all of Praetoria.  Your assistance will prove to be most valuable to the city; however it must be done with precision."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3918771178" "Our work here within the Rift Enclosure is exceptionally sensitive.  I am not at liberty to discuss our work with anyone not possessing adequate security clearance."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1637247301" "My name is Professor Volkov, and I am the personal assistant to Praetor Keyes.  I am responsible for running the tests on the procedures the Praetor devises.  His work will ultimately lead us to a whole new world, ripe with... new possibilities.<br><br>I am in need of those bold enough to venture to worlds unknown and bring back data from these alien landscapes.  Do you have the courage to change our world's future history?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P390792892" "There is nothing more that you can help with that you have not already done, {HeroName}."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P71340566" "My assignments require the utmost attention.  If you are distracted with tasks from other people, I can not rely upon your help."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3611873970" "The mission I have requires a more experience xeno-traveller.  Once you have reached Security Level {Level}, please return to me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P994930208" "Your expertise in xeno-exploration has already begun to reap a bountiful harvest of knowledge.  With our continued work, we may yet find a suitable world for our people to successfully colonize."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1786181567" "Praetor Berry has much to owe to you, {HeroName}, as well I.  I'm not sure how I can express to you how much you've helped."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
