// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Research Assistant Dabi 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3963169694" "Research Assistant Dabi"
// ProfessionString :
"P864187563" "Research Assistant"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P4074221447" "I'm glad you're on our side.  I don't know how much longer I can keep up my disguise before they find out that I'm not one of them."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2588200115" "I'm sorry, but I'm compiling very important datastrings for Professor Volkov right now, so I have no time to talk."
// FirstVisitString :
"P259000639" "Hi... um... oh I so hope that you're really on our side.  My name is Dabi, Dabi Sokal.  I've been collecting as much information Anti-Matter doesn't keep secure.  I need to get this off my hands before they start suspecting me.  You'll get this back to Scott, right?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3441952071" "I don't have any more datastrings to pass on.  It might be a good idea if you don't talk with me or both of our covers might be blown."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1077936063" "I can't allow anyone to be suspicious of what we're doing.  You'll need to finish your other tasks before I can hand this data to you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1709071110" "I thank you for wanting to help me, but you're going to need to be Security Level {Level} before the buyers on the street will talk with you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4073089685" "You've really helped me out, {HeroName}.  You'll never know how much I appreciate it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4052257056" "You may have saved my life, {HeroName}.  I'll always remember you."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
