// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Saboteur Natalia 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P339746265" "Saboteur Natalia"
// ProfessionString :
"P2160998235" "Saboteur"
// DescriptionString :
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P576960350" "You only live once is what I say.  Make the most of it.  And try to make it an explosive time!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2653352177" "I know you're staring, sweetie, but don't be so obvious about it, okay?  Try being a little more subtle.  Might get you somewhere... you never know."
// FirstVisitString :
"P161243548" "You can call me Natalia, sweetie.  I'm the head of demolitions for our cause out here in the Rift.  People tell me I have a fiery personality, and I love proving them right.  But now that you're here, you can help me give Tyrant a taste of his own medicine, yes?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3325049569" "I've got all the boom taken care of, sweetie."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2571975370" "I can't... use... you if you're doing other tasks.  Take care of them, then come back so you can take care of some of... my... tasks, okay sweetie?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3493988740" "My tasks are too big for you to handle right now, sweetie.  Why don't you stop by when you're Security Level {Level}, okay sweetie?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1569315193" "Hey, sweetie.  You're doing a real good job out there, you know?  Here... take down my number.  Feel free to call me for... whatever."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P832309572" "I'd almost say you did a better job than me out there, sweetie.  But I'm still the best.  Don't ever forget that."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
